# Cursor publishing

**LIVE_MODULAR_PUBLISHING_ENABLED.** Read `.dentcast/workflows/README.md`, `.dentcast/workflows/agent-parity.md` and the shared active files listed in `.dentcast/workflows/global/README.md`.
Load complete `modules/01-hard-rules.md` and `02-routing-intake.md`, then every applicable full module in the order listed in README. Preserve human approvals, source-based DES/Fidelity, category exceptions, builders, English, notification and Phase F. Staging utilities cannot replace real steps. Legacy files are backup only; do not read them for execution.

## Interrupted publication

For «انتشار ناقص داشتم», «ادامه انتشار», "resume publishing", or equivalent, first read `.dentcast/PUBLISH-HANDOFF.md`, then `.dentcast/workflows/publish-handoff.md`. Check the same fixed path before a new publication. Never overwrite unfinished work. Update it after every canonical step and before handing off; delete it only after verified completion. A missing file or unavailable work must be reported, not invented. Local commits and dirty files are not automatically available in another checkout.
